# Sv32 combined virtual-address plus ASID selective-fence smoke test.
# Host setup preloads:
# - x1 = translated virtual address shared by both address spaces
# - x2 = satp for ASID 1 mapping to value A
# - x3 = satp for ASID 2 mapping to value B
# - x4 = target ASID for the selective sfence.vma
# - x5 = physical leaf-PTE address for the ASID 1 mapping
# - x6 = replacement leaf PTE mapping ASID 1 to value C
# - x7 = physical leaf-PTE address for the ASID 2 mapping
# - x8 = replacement leaf PTE mapping ASID 2 to value D
# - x9 = mstatus with MPRV and MPP=Supervisor
# - x14 = mstatus with only MPP=Supervisor
# Expect x10 = A, x11 = B, x12 = C after `sfence.vma x1, x4`, x13 = stale B in ASID 2,
# and x15 = D only after a full `sfence.vma`.
# Trailing nops leave safe speculative fetch space for the pipeline core.
